WEBVTT

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:48.750
Gareki-kun.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.840
We've been given permission.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.090
Let's go in.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:57.800
Come on, what's Nai-chan's condition?!

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.640
Tell me, Gramps!

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.260
Gareki-kun, keep down.
Tell me, Gramps!

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.770
Hold your tongue!
Huh?

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.440
Moron, you're being too loud around the patient!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.480
Phantom Picnic
Score 3

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.240
There are no injuries on his body,

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.740
but for a moment there was a strong disturbance in his brain waves.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.490
Now he has temporarily lost consciousness.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.490
You should probably investigate the reason behind this at the Research Tower.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.740
I see...

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.960
Then, I shall not waste any more time and will take my leave immediately.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:29.750
Take that fool over there with you!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.880
Feel free to use him for human experimentation.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.590
Doc, when will he regain consciousness?

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.510
I'm responsible...

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.470
I was entrusted to look after him and yet...

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:45.980
His condition is stable, so I think he should wake up soon.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:51.600
Tsukumo, you should learn to relax more.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.780
You only need to shoulder your own responsibilities.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.870
I'll take my leave now!

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.160
Please, take care of Nai-kun!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.370
Hmm?

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.500
Ma~ Ma~ Ma~ Ma~

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.130
He was in so much pain before,

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:11.710
and yet you say there's nothing wrong with him.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.250
You're not some kind of quack, are you?

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:17.550
You're such a foul-mouthed kid.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.050
Worried about your friend?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.430
We just happened to be together.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.430
It's ridiculous to assume that we're friends.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.890
Encounters happen both through coincidence and through the course of nature.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.650
If trust grows from within here,

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.190
you'll be friends forever.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.660
Hey! Where are you going?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.450
Supper! I'm going for supper!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.950
Make sure you look after him!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.200
What?!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.330
<i>Nai.</i>

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.580
<i>Why aren't you devoting all your attention to finding me?</i>

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.000
<i>Is there someone by your side?</i>

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.010
Karoku!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.970
Where are you?

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:07.310
<i>What kind of person is he?</i>

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.730
Oh, Gareki...

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.770
<i>To be able to make friends with someone...</i>

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.020
<i>that's my boy.</i>

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:19.150
<i>But...  let's say goodbye to that person.</i>

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.030
Huh?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.400
But... why?

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.080
<i>Well, because I don't want you to feel sad.</i>

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.910
<i>You should tell him, "Gareki, I don't need you!"</i>

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.330
But I... Gareki is...

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:40.670
<i>You wouldn't want him to be dragged into the scary things happening around you,</i>

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.970
<i>and be broken, would you?</i>

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.640
Ga–

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:56.320
You startled me.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.650
How are you feeling?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.660
If there's anything you want me to do, I'll hear you out this time.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:06.410
Ga–

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.660
<i>You wouldn't want him to be broken, would you?</i>

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.960
Gareki, I don't need you.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:16.830
What?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.670
Gareki, I don't...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.670
Tell me... what do you mean by that?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:23.720
Huh?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.430
Gareki's sca–

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.770
I'm scary? You're saying this after all we've been through?

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.430
Ga–

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.360
Gareki!

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.440
What's up with that?

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.200
Are you telling me that you'll give me what I want, so I should just go away?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.750
Since you're already acquainted with Circus...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:56.210
Sorry, but I hate people who act innocent but are actually opportunists.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.240
That hurt...

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:28.030
Geez... Gramps, you're no ordinary old man,

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.830
so go easy on me– Huh?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:30.660
What?

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.160
Huh? What?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:33.830
Gareki-kun?

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.830
Tell that bearded old geezer that the damn brat is awake!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.830
I get it... so just calm down.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.710
All right? Okay?

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:42.540
Wai–

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:44.550
Gareki-kun!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:46.710
Gareki-kun!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.470
Huh?

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:54.310
What's wrong?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.390
Where does it hurt?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.900
Um... what should I do?

00:06:58.860 --> 00:06:59.440
Tsukumo-chan... huh?

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.610
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:02.280
<i>Yogi?
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!</i>

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:03.280
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.150
<i>What's the matter?
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!</i>

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:04.440
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.400
<i>Yogi?
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!</i>

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:06.820
What...?
Off-limits! Off-limits! Off-limits!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:07.780
What...?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.370
I got it.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.370
Tsukumo, I'll leave it to you.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.540
So? You didn't come here for supper, did you?

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.130
About that boy's body...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.670
What's wrong with Nai's body?

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.970
Are there any significant problems with it?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.680
Well... to put it simply,

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.810
that boy isn't human.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.180
He's an animal.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.060
It's natural that you'd feel shocked–

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:46.690
What a bad joke... oh no it's nothing.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.570
I heard that!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.070
Here! Take a look at this!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.820
This is the true form of that boy!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:55.620
Say what?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.450
No way...

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:02.250
I've come to this conclusion based on cellular tissue samples extracted from his body.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.710
Its scientific name is "Niji."

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.590
Its species can only be found in the Niji Forest, which contains a unique ecosystem.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.720
It's an extremely rare animal.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.720
I can't believe it...

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.930
Wait, wait a second!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.350
But if what Doc says is true...

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.350
Um... well...

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.150
<i>Does he expect me to believe that Nai's not actually human...</i>

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.860
<i>That based on the data, he's an animal...</i>

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:27.360
<i>There's no way I can simply accept all this!</i>

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.610
<i>Since meeting members of Circus,</i>

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.200
<i>I've learned that there are humans who become monsters.</i>

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:37.660
<i>Though it's true that Nai's actions always tend to be a bit strange...</i>

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:41.170
<i>Does this mean that up until now...</i>

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.090
<i>I'm Gareki.</i>

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.290
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.290
<i>Nai!</i>

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.380
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.300
<i>Come again?</i>

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.550
<i>You saved me again!</i>

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.310
<i>Gareki, I don't need you!</i>

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.050
<i>Don't need you! Don't need you!
Gareki, I don't need you!</i>

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:03.100
<i>I've been such a fool?!</i>

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.770
I've talked to the Research Tower.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.940
Bring him there tomorrow.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.440
Urp... I'm going to see Akari-sensei?

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.700
Oh... that reminds me, about Nai-chan's bracelet,

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.620
you're not going to take it from him?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.120
I'm just trying to see if it responds to that boy.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.080
Huh?

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:27.420
But wouldn't the bracelet only respond to its owner?

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.260
Nai-chan said it was left by that guy, Karoku.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.340
What if he's lying?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:32.960
No way...

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.970
If he's a member of Kafka, it would be possible, right?

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:37.470
Well...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.890
I was surprised to find out about his body...

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.470
but I'm sure he's a good boy!

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.940
Wai– What are you laughing about?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:46.850
Oh nothing...

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.480
That's why I assigned you to him.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.900
You're probably thinking that I'll definitely go easy on him...

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.240
Don't think too much about it.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.150
All these little safeguards are just a precaution.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.780
Sit.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.130
<i>I should calm down.</i>

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:12.420
<i>He's just a boy... no, just an animal.</i>

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.800
<i>No matter how you look at it, he looks like a human...</i>

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.300
<i>And now they're saying that he's an animal?</i>

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.930
<i>That just makes me even more embarrassed!</i>

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.560
I'll look like a fool if I get angry.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.810
In fact, you've always asked me for help, so what's this about me being scary?!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.070
Talk to me!

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.060
You're not scary!

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:32.230
What?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:37.990
I was told that you would be broken... by Karoku.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.740
Karoku?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.950
Never mind.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.250
Go on.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.710
If I don't want you getting dragged into the scary things, and being broken...

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:52.540
Karoku said I should say goodbye.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.510
He said it would be better if I told you that I didn't need you.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:11:00.220
How can you speak to a person you can't even find?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:01.970
Just now...

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.720
Before I woke up...

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:07.400
<i>He's trying to tell me... that it happened in a dream?</i>

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.730
<i>Damn animal!</i>

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:13.570
<i>He said I should say goodbye to avoid you being broken.</i>

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:16.530
<i>He said it would be better if I said I didn't need you.</i>

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:21.530
<i>Now that I think about it, what a </i>"great"<i> personality that guy has.</i>

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.240
<i>He seems like a hypocrite...</i>

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.370
I'll ask again. What's your relationship with Karoku?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.540
Karoku's always been with me–

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.880
You've already said that!

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:36.510
So, how long have you been so close?

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:37.720
As long as I remember...

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:39.130
Roughly when?

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.060
<i>He doesn't know?</i>

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:48.390
Well then, did you tell Karoku about me?

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.270
I told him I was with you...

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.980
<i>Is that all?</i>

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.570
<i>Then, why did Karoku try to keep me away from him?</i>

00:11:56.570 --> 00:12:00.400
<i>Those words even seem to have malicious intent.</i>

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.700
<i>Also if he can communicate, why did he leave this boy alone?</i>

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.410
<i>In fact, how is he communicating.</i>

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:13.870
<i>If that's how he sets off communication, he really does have some </i>"great"<i> taste.</i>

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.890
<i>Well, my impression of you has changed quite a bit, Karoku.</i>

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.930
<i>On top of that, he's picking a fight with me...</i>

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.230
Gareki?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:37.940
First of all; I'm sorry, I heard you wrong.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.570
I don't really dislike you.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.330
Moreover,

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.080
I have no intention of being broken.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.340
I've also taken interest in meeting Karoku

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:56.750
Sure.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.970
From now on, you will be examined in the Research Tower.

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:08.470
If it's about Nai being an animal and not being human,

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.600
he won't be treated like a lab animal, will he?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.520
Doc will go with you.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.650
If they try to use Nai for any experiments, scream and beg him to help.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.860
What kind of advice is that?

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.730
Yogi,

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.480
I will leave these two in your care.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:25.370
Yes, but what about Hirato-san and Tsukumo-chan?

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:27.610
We're being called to Round Table Z?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:33.370
Why didn't they take them to the Research Tower right away?

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.880
I think their reason for being cautious is to find out who the real owner of that bracelet is.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.300
Their methods are messed up.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.380
We'll find out when we get there.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:48.550
Fly... high!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:54.020
Yahooo!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.270
Hey, Tsukumo-senpai.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.530
Long time no see.

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.950
Did you gain a little weight?

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.820
Now now.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:13.540
Those companies that cooperate with Kafka are not only good at hiding their association,

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.660
but the number of Varuga which had decreased at one point are starting to increase again.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:24.800
They stole the evolution research we had sealed, and are using it as we speak.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:30.050
We have to protect many lives from the mistakes of our former comrades.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.980
And, Hirato.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:35.520
About the boy that Doc has reported on...

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:42.060
There is nothing physically wrong with you, including your blood cells.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.570
Everything is fine, except for your personality.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.070
Then, I'll take these off.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.120
Thank you for your trouble.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.740
We have a room ready for you. Get some rest.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.450
Come to think of it, where is Yogi?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.000
I don't know.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.960
He left before I noticed.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:14:59.960
Well, I thought he was already getting prodded, he's such a pain in the neck.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.210
No one else is around.
Well, I thought he was already getting prodded, he's such a pain in the neck.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.340
He's not around...
Well, I thought he was already getting prodded, he's such a pain in the neck.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.050
What are you doing?

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.550
What! Ah, Akari-sensei.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.050
Are you changing your bandage every day?

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.430
The reaction can be terrifying, if you don't take it seriously.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.350
Okay.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:18.230
If you forget it again, treatment would not be as easy as the last time.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:25.360
Well, I.. I.. will try my best.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.170
It looks a lot like where I lived with Karoku.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.460
Where?

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.410
Right there.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.750
What was the place Gareki lived like?

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.470
It was a filthy dump.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:16:02.190
<i>When you're in a dirty place with dirty people, you don't forget the anger towards them.</i>

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.190
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:05.810
<i>I haven't forgotten</i>

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:07.650
<i>But...</i>

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:13.820
Since I met you, I feel like I only see pure things.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:18.540
Seeing so many things and learning how to think purely,

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.830
then growing up and forgetting the anger.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.830
I don't want to be the only one who is comfortable.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:30.090
<i>But if, unconsciously, I wanted to escape...</i>

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:34.220
<i>If being with Nai prevents me from running away.</i>

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.350
<i>Should I go back?</i>

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.350
Gareki.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.310
If you can see pure things as pure,

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.730
that means Gareki's eyes are pure too!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.740
Gareki, what's wrong?

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:52.450
<i>It's fine.</i>

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.780
<i>I was pretty pissed off.</i>

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.490
<i>I </i>am<i> still filthy.</i>

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.920
Gareki...

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:14.260
His internal body formation is quite similar to a Varuga,

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.980
but Nai is a new species formed from the miraculous...

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:20.850
co-existence and amalgamation of human and Niji cells.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:26.100
The one who created Nai is undoubtedly a genius.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.480
Then, dissect him immediately to unravel the details.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.400
Tsukumo,

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.570
sit down.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:37.910
I cannot follow that order.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:38.910
What?

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:42.660
If we dissect him, we will lose an enormous amount of invaluable data.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:47.210
I cannot accept throwing away such a masterpiece without any consideration.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.640
They are from Doc.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.920
Hooray!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.470
Treating you like a pet...

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.560
Aren't you just being used?

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.430
That's not true!

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:06.810
Nai-chan offered to come with us of his own accord.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.190
<i>Niji Forest?</i>

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.740
<i>The place we think you were living.</i>

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.940
<i>We may find something out if we go there.</i>

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.580
<i>About both Nai-chan and Karoku-san.</i>

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.700
<i>If you don't wish to cooperate with us and would rather leave instead,</i>

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.580
<i>I'll make sure I "sleep soundly" tonight.</i>

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.460
<i>I will go.</i>

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:31.970
<i>I want to truly understand what Karoku meant.</i>

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:39.090
<i>I also want to have a better understanding of what everyone is thinking.</i>

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.140
You're such a good boy, Nai-chan.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.810
You're annoying.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.470
Hurry up and take off already!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:49.320
Then, we'll be blasting off toward Niji Forest!

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:50.280
Blast off? For what?
Then, we'll be blasting off toward Niji Forest!

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:50.940
Blast off? For what?

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.030
U-Um...

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.200
Sorry, well, we're taking off.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:04.410
Niji Forest is a peculiar area where unnatural rainbows and mirages occur.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:08.830
Its unique ecological electromagnetic waves influence the optical nerve.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:13.090
This electromagnetic wave causes all electronic devices to malfunction.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:18.100
So, this leads to a search that can only depend on hearing.

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:23.600
<i>So that's why Nai, being an animal from that place, is so sensitive to sound...</i>

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.910
<i>It's been about an hour.</i>

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:41.950
<i>He is walking without hesitation, where there is no distinct trail.</i>

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.000
<i>Is that a mirage?</i>

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:51.960
Let's go.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.860
Only the house is burnt.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.950
The destruction wasn't due to natural causes.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:17.820
Check it out.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.030
Yes.
Yes.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.870
<i>It was seen in the aerial photos of the forest.</i>

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:28.370
<i>It would have been impossible to reach without Nai.</i>

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.460
<i>Some unnatural being came to erase the evidence.</i>

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.800
Nai-chan.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.260
Cheer up.

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:39.880
There is another place I stayed for a long time.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.090
Where is it?

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.100
Here.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.600
A cave?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.690
Get down!

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:53.600
Huh?

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.060
Varuga?!

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:04.830
Are you after Nai-chan again?

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:09.910
I'm actually scared of fighting since failure isn't an option.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.540
But I will fight if I need to fight!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:31.810
Nai!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.190
Damn it!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.530
Gareki-kun!

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:29.130
Hey, what do they mean when they say you're an animal?

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:29.920
Well...

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:31.130
You seem human in every way.

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:33.350
Don't tell me, maybe you can transform?

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:33.600
Huh?

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:36.310
Go ahead and transform. I'm interested. Do it now!

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:39.180
What on earth do you mean by "transform"?!
